 'This presentation brings together experiences in particle physics, scientific infrastructure, education and community work to show how available resources can become practical capabilities. Its purpose is to <strong>bring infrastructure closer to people</strong>, reduce the technical barriers to getting started and help students and researchers focus on asking questions, interpreting results and producing knowledge.',
